Vexillological symbols are encoded at 0x2221 to 0x2234:
  2221 -- normal, de jure, obverse side
  2222 -- proposed, not officially adopted
  2223 -- reconstructed
  2224 -- reverse side
  2225 -- variant
  2226 -- alternate
  2227 -- de facto, not official but commonly known
  2228 -- two sided, different obverse than reverse
  2229 -- sinister, hoisted with pole to observer's right
  222A -- officially authorized
  222B -- historical, now abandoned
  222C -- mirror, reverse side is mirror of obverse side
  222D -- equal, reverse side is congruent of obverse side
  222E -- no info about reverse side
  222F -- vertical normal, hoist transformationally identical to horizontal hoist
  2230 -- rotated when hoisted vertically
  2231 -- vertical unknown
  2232 -- vertical not applicable, no rotatable element
  2233 -- vertical only
  2234 -- not authorized to represent group or country

Vexillological usage symbols are encoded at 0x223F to 0x227E by starting
with 0x223F and adding the following numbers according to the usage:
  0001 -- Private/Land
  0002 -- Public/Land
  0004 -- Military/Land
  0008 -- Private/Water
  0010 -- Public/Water
  0020 -- Military/Water


